# Natural rubber (cis-1,4-polyisoprene): Y. Takahashi & T. Kumano, Macromolecules 37, 4860 (2004), doi:10.1021/ma0305683
# space group P21/a (b unique, c the chain axis) (No. 14), Z = 8 C5H8 per cell; cell p. 4860 and Fig. 5 p. 4862 (beta 93.1 deg; the abstract prints 94.6); Table 2 p. 4862 (all atoms)
# correction / model: beta = 93.1 deg (text and Fig. 5) rather than the abstract's 94.6 deg: the coordinates give regular bond lengths with 93.1 deg only
# correction / model: ordered model: every site holds the Table 2 molecule. The paper refines a statistical structure in which the mirror image about y = 1/8 occupies a site with 33 % weight; a DFT cell needs one orientation
# hydrogens: the paper's
